<section class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT TALAZO</p><h1>African ingenuity.<br /><em>Agricultural possibility.</em></h1><p>We’re building agricultural intelligence around the people who know the land best: the farmers who work it.</p><a class="underlined" href="#team">Meet the team <span>↓</span></a></section>
<section class="intro section"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHY WE EXIST</p><h2>Better information.<br /><span>Stronger possibilities.</span></h2></div><div class="intro-body"><p class="large-copy">Talazo is an African agricultural intelligence social enterprise with a farmer-first mission.</p><p>Farmers make important choices every day, often with an incomplete picture of what is happening across their crops. We believe accessible monitoring technology can help bring that picture into focus.</p><p>Our work connects a practical question—what is happening in the field?—with a wider ambition: more resilient, resource-conscious agriculture in Africa.</p><a class="underlined" href="/our-purpose">Explore our purpose <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
<figure class="photo-band"><img class="" src="/images/crop-fields.jpg" alt="Young maize plants growing in fertile soil" loading="lazy" width="1600" height="1067" /><figcaption>Our purpose begins with the land and the people who care for it.</figcaption></figure><section class="section about-values"><p class="eyebrow">HOW WE WORK</p><h2>Our roots run deep.</h2><div class="steps"><article><div class="step-top"><span>01</span></div><h3>Farmers come first.</h3><p>We start with the decisions farmers face and listen to what would make information useful in their daily work.</p></article><article><div class="step-top"><span>02</span></div><h3>Purpose shapes progress.</h3><p>We connect technological development with care for crops, natural resources, and farming communities.</p></article><article><div class="step-top"><span>03</span></div><h3>Learning is shared.</h3><p>We value field experience and open conversations as we shape and refine our crop monitoring approach.</p></article></div></section>
